 - 2026-06-16: PHASE C1 (ARC north star; accuracy) -- monotonic ARC +1 on a NEW game. exp4261 found NO verifier-validated level-up candidate on sc25 L6 (no advance, 19 levels held). Per ARC-AGI-3 Incremental-Progress Scoping (+1, NOT all-levels) + Failed-Experiment Rerun Discipline (a new approach, not a re-run): target the best-headroom UNATTEMPTED game from the 25-game survey, with the hardened set-encoder routing the offline solver's candidate ranking. Advance ONE game by >=1 NEW real-env-confirmed level (total_levels 19 -> >=20). Report total_levels + the game advanced + levels_completed (from the solver's real-env-confirmed output, not a self-report). NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission. An honest no-advance is COMPLETE and informs the next game pick (NOT churn -- it is a different game than .394). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: incremental_progress_wa30-ee6fef47_advanced_to_L1_total20; results/experiment_4275_arc_incremental_progress_new_game.json
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE D1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .395 bleeding-edge forks (cross-family/cross-task verifier generalization, ARC-TGI family-generator pools, discrete-diffusion verifier-guidance after the loader fix, online-adaptation self-learning) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .396 roadmap conditioned on the .395 cross-family outcome. Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- the /deep-research harness is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real arXiv ID/URL. Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v396 (the strongest method conditioned on whether cross-family generalized or collapsed). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v396_mapped; results/experiment_4276_sota_ingestion_v396.json
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE D2 (hygiene) -- reconcile the verifier registry + gaps to .395 truth, run the GAP-4 regression guard, RECORD the .394/.395 retirements, and LOG missing-verifier gaps. Record the .395 outcomes: the cross-family OOD verdict (did the win GENERALIZE to held-out families or collapse to within-pool?), the online-adaptation self-learning result, the DiffusionGemma loader-fix + preflight GO/NO-GO, the ARC +1 advance. RECORD the standing retirements into ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml: code oracle-distinct replication CORPUS-SPECIFIC (exp4264 delta -0.006 -> the .392 +3.1pp stands single-corpus, RETIRE the code-replication ask) and verifier-as-reward OUT-OF-BAND (exp4263 ready_for_out_of_band -> in-loop axis is operator-owned). Update ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md (per Missing-Verifier Gap Logging: e.g. a 'cross-family ARC selection' gap if A2/A3 collapsed). Run the GAP-4 execution regression guard (no regression vs .394). Emit regression_guard_passed BARE bool. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_manifest_reconciled_to_v395_truth_regression_guard_passed_True_retirements_2_gaps_logged_1; results/experiment_4277_verifier_registry_gaps_hygiene.json
+- 2026-06-16: PHASE D3 (hardware continuity; opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 terminal/opportunistic (SSH-only reachability + xmutil listapps; NO host SD-card precondition), PolarFire CPU dispatch hash-verify, GateMate USB detect. KV260 is terminal (north-star §3) so the per-board mandate relaxes to opportunistic; this task keeps the boards visible without blocking the milestone. Report per-board reachability + any opportunistic result. NO board blocks the milestone (honest blocked_<board> per board is fine). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_4278_kv260_kv260_terminal_xmutil_listapps_blocked_returncode_1_polarfire_polarfire_hash_verified_cpu_dispatch_succeeded_gatemate_blocked_gatemate_unreachable_ssh_usb_reachability_only; results/experiment_4278_hardware_continuity.json
